#==============================================================================================
#
#   sk_path_measure - SkPathMeasure: lengths along a path, and points and tangents at them
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Skia m144 src/core/SkPathMeasure.cpp (lines 22-60) and
#       src/core/SkContourMeasure.cpp (lines 27-40 t values, 137-495 building a contour's
#       segments, 460-500 compute_pos_tan, 500-630 the iterator, SkTKSearch,
#       distanceToSegment and getPosTan), with SkPoint::Length, ::Distance and
#       set_point_length from src/core/SkPoint.cpp:22-92. Gfx::Path::place_text_along measures
#       the first contour of a path this way. getSegment and getMatrix are not ported (the
#       port has no caller for them).
